ky 0.0 0.0 0.0
kz 8995953.759572976970660883263721114 8995953.759474347513950220782899023 8995953.759572976970660883263721114
omega 2696919089636723.796411820078082015 2696919089636723.796411170152669518 2696919089636723.796411820078082015
rabifreq 1000.0 1000.0 1000.0
wtype ripple ripple ripple
phi0 0.0 0.0 0.0
